--- !u!114 &824496278
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 824496274}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 57603701dd0147e43b5295c375e99a88, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  dialogue:
    dialogueLines:
    - character:
        name: Elder Cap
        icon: {fileID: 8238638941979423301, guid: 6ead8f8e694501b4eb48a851baedab56, type: 3}
      line: Congratulations Faye on saving Shrooliver and Chantarella!
    - character:
        name: Elder Cap
        icon: {fileID: 8238638941979423301, guid: 6ead8f8e694501b4eb48a851baedab56, type: 3}
      line: But your journey is not over yet.
    - character:
        name: Elder Cap
        icon: {fileID: 8238638941979423301, guid: 6ead8f8e694501b4eb48a851baedab56, type: 3}
      line: I'm sure there are more Goldcaps who need your help further into the
        forest,
    - character:
        name: Elder Cap
        icon: {fileID: 8238638941979423301, guid: 6ead8f8e694501b4eb48a851baedab56, type: 3}
      line: And most importantly the king still needs your help.
    - character:
        name: Elder Cap
        icon: {fileID: 8238638941979423301, guid: 6ead8f8e694501b4eb48a851baedab56, type: 3}
      line: I'm sorry Faye but i cannot follow you any further into the forest and
        continue to guide you in your journey,
    - character:
        name: Elder Cap
        icon: {fileID: 8238638941979423301, guid: 6ead8f8e694501b4eb48a851baedab56, type: 3}
      line: For the forest is to dangerous and toxic for an old soul like me.
    - character:
        name: Elder Cap
        icon: {fileID: 8238638941979423301, guid: 6ead8f8e694501b4eb48a851baedab56, type: 3}
      line: You'll have to do without me but don't worry,
    - character:
        name: Elder Cap
        icon: {fileID: 8238638941979423301, guid: 6ead8f8e694501b4eb48a851baedab56, type: 3}
      line: I've taught you everything i know and all you need to know,
    - character:
        name: Elder Cap
        icon: {fileID: 8238638941979423301, guid: 6ead8f8e694501b4eb48a851baedab56, type: 3}
      line: I have no doubt you'll find your path, this was always your fate Faye,
        to be Mycelia's great protector.
    - character:
        name: Elder Cap
