    - target: {fileID: 7350832452455051506, guid: b6834b7c6383039439c88fbc14c6febc, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogue.dialogueLines.Array.size
      value: 4
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7350832452455051506, guid: b6834b7c6383039439c88fbc14c6febc, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogue.dialogueLines.Array.data[0].line
      value: Why hello there Winged One. Many thanks for releasing me. How did you
        find me? No matter, not important.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7350832452455051506, guid: b6834b7c6383039439c88fbc14c6febc, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogue.dialogueLines.Array.data[1].line
      value: Have you found my sister? She's around here somewhere. Please, if it's
        not too much to ask, help her as well.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7350832452455051506, guid: b6834b7c6383039439c88fbc14c6febc, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogue.dialogueLines.Array.data[2].line
      value: Oh by the way, before you leave. If you're going deeper into the forest,
        beware of loose and shaky ground. Almost plunged to my death before, Haha!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7350832452455051506, guid: b6834b7c6383039439c88fbc14c6febc, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogue.dialogueLines.Array.data[3].line
      value: Appreciate the warning, and don't worry. I won't let anything happen
        to her.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
