--- !u!114 &1641624677
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1641624672}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 57603701dd0147e43b5295c375e99a88, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  dialogue:
    dialogueLines:
    - character:
        name: Elder Cap
        icon: {fileID: 8238638941979423301, guid: 6ead8f8e694501b4eb48a851baedab56, type: 3}
      line: There they are!
    - character:
        name: Elder Cap
        icon: {fileID: 8238638941979423301, guid: 6ead8f8e694501b4eb48a851baedab56, type: 3}
      line: Those pesky Agarics, careful of them they bite.
    - character:
        name: Elder Cap
        icon: {fileID: 8238638941979423301, guid: 6ead8f8e694501b4eb48a851baedab56, type: 3}
      line: However luckily for you, so can you.
    - character:
        name: Elder Cap
        icon: {fileID: 8238638941979423301, guid: 6ead8f8e694501b4eb48a851baedab56, type: 3}
      line: They cannot withstand the good ol' harddrop on the noggin'.
    - character:
        name: Elder Cap
        icon: {fileID: 8238638941979423301, guid: 6ead8f8e694501b4eb48a851baedab56, type: 3}
      line: This was a technique developed by the ancient Goldcaps where they would
        gather up vertical momentum and then....
    - character:
        name: Elder Cap
        icon: {fileID: 8238638941979423301, guid: 6ead8f8e694501b4eb48a851baedab56, type: 3}
      line: STOMP ON THE HEADS OF THE AGARICS AS HARD AS POSSIBLE AN--
    - character:
        name: Elder Cap
        icon: {fileID: 8238638941979423301, guid: 6ead8f8e694501b4eb48a851baedab56, type: 3}
      line: '*clears throat* sorry got a little carried away there. The general gist
        of the technique is to'
    - character:
        name: Elder Cap
        icon: {fileID: 8238638941979423301, guid: 6ead8f8e694501b4eb48a851baedab56, type: 3}
      line: fly far in the air and then hold S to hard drop on the agarics head.
    - character:
        name: Elder Cap
        icon: {fileID: 8238638941979423301, guid: 6ead8f8e694501b4eb48a851baedab56, type: 3}
      line: The key is timing.
    - character:
        name: Elder Cap
        icon: {fileID: 8238638941979423301, guid: 6ead8f8e694501b4eb48a851baedab56, type: 3}
      line: Go on give it a try and get rid of they're putrid odor.
    automaticAdvance: 0
    autoAdvanceDelay: 1.5
  ableToWalkDuringDialogue: 1
